<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50317" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĕhĕmentĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f.
		id. (post-Aug.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Eagerness</i>, <i>fervency</i>, <i>vehemence</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pollio Asinius fuit acris vehementiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 5, 4, § 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gracchi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 1, 11, 14</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Strength</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">odoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					13, 8, 16, § 59</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saporis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					19, 5, 27, § 88</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 23, 1, 21, § 36</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venarum,</span>”
				i. e. <i>a strong pulse</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					23, 1, 24, § 48</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">linteorum strigilumque,</span>”
				i. e. <i>a copious use</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					28, 4, 14, § 55</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Of
			language: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter hujus generis et illius superioris
					vehementiam hoc interest,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Auct. Her. 4, 19, 26</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
